<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8860] IgniteDiscoveryThread marker interface should be restored on RingMessageWorker class</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8860</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It seems that &lt;b&gt;IgniteDiscoveryThread&lt;/b&gt; interface was removed from &lt;b&gt;ServerImpl.RingMessageWorker&lt;/b&gt; class.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It should be restored as it is used to prevent deadlocks on updates of BinaryMetadata.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
